<title>UK: Royal &amp; Sun buys back 3 mln shares.</title>
<headline>Royal &amp; Sun buys back 3 mln shares.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brokers Cazenove &amp; Co and ABN AMRO Hoare Govett said on Friday they had bought three million ordinary shares in Royal &amp; Sun Alliance Insurance Group Plc on behalf of the company.</p>
<p>The brokers said they bought the shares for cancellation at 460p per share.</p>
<p>On Thursday, the brokers bought back 3.5 million shares at 465p each. Royal &amp; Sun said last week it would repurchase up to five percent of its shares.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 5106</p>
</text>
